  "job_C11.11_20251003_115128": {
    "chunk_text": "yr & h\u00e6te Benedicite ignis et aestus domino. Cyle & sumor Benedicite frigus et \u00ebstas domino. Deawas & rimforst Benedicite rores et pruina domino. Forst & cyle Benedicite gelu et frigus domino. Is & snawas Benedicite glacies et niues domino. Nihta & dagas Benedicite noctes et dies domino. Leoht & \u00f0ystru Benedicite lux et tenebrae domino. Leoman & weolcnu Benedicite fulgura et nubes domino. Bletsie eor\u00f0e herie heo & upahebbe hine to weoruldum Benedicat terra domino laudet et Duna & hylla Benedicite montes et colles domino. Ealle spryttende \u00feingc on eor\u00fean Benedicite uniuersa germinantia in terra domino. Wyllas Benedicite fontes domino. S\u00e6s & flod Benedicite maria et flumina domino. Hwalas & ealle \u00feingc \u00fee styria\u00fe on w\u00e6terum Benedicite caete et omnia qu\u00eb mouentur in aquis Ealle fugelas heofonan Benedicite omnes uolucres caeli domino. Ealle wilddeor & nytenu Benedicite omnes bestiae et pecora domino. Bearn manna Benedicite filii hominum domino. Benedicat israel domino laudet et superexaltet eum in saecula. Sacerdas Benedicite sacerdotes domini domino. \u00deeowan drihtnes Benedicite serui domini domino. Gastas & sawla rihtwisra Benedicite spiritus et animae iustorum domino. Halgan & eadmode on heortan Benedicite sancti et humiles corde domino. Heria\u00fe utan bletsian f\u00e6der & sunu mid \u00feam halgan gaste utan herian & utan upahebben hine to Gebletsod for\u00fean \u00fee he geneosode & dyde alysednysse \u00fe",
